{"logId": "94f987ae-be27-43b4-952a-05f938e38530", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 2800, "height": 2000, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "融入和丰富胖东来文化", "block_bbox": [220, 113, 687, 162], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[220.0, 113.0], [687.0, 113.0], [687.0, 162.0], [220.0, 162.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2. 在接受任何职位前，应先得到培训。", "block_bbox": [174, 181, 873, 232], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[174.0, 181.0], [873.0, 181.0], [873.0, 232.0], [174.0, 232.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3. 培训应当顺应顾客的期望，并有利于员工个人的发展和职位晋升。", "block_bbox": [174, 250, 1408, 300], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[174.0, 250.0], [1408.0, 250.0], [1408.0, 300.0], [174.0, 300.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4. 管理层对培训的质量负责：他们参与培训并定期监督培训的实施情况。", "block_bbox": [173, 317, 1491, 369], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[173.0, 317.0], [1491.0, 317.0], [1491.0, 369.0], [173.0, 369.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "三、培训组织结构", "block_bbox": [101, 385, 445, 435], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[101.0, 385.0], [445.0, 385.0], [445.0, 435.0], [101.0, 435.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "胖东来培训机构：", "block_bbox": [178, 454, 500, 503], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[178.0, 454.0], [500.0, 454.0], [500.0, 503.0], [178.0, 503.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1. 处长以上级别的培训（包括店长、培训店长和处长），由上级主管部门进行培训。", "block_bbox": [174, 522, 1698, 572], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[174.28955078125, 513.0017700195312], [1697.28955078125, 522.0017700195312], [1697.0, 571.0000610351562], [174.0, 562.0000610351562]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2. 课长级别培训（包括课长、培训课长、服务部门主管和助理）由各机构负责人负责培训。", "block_bbox": [173, 590, 1823, 640], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[173.0, 590.0], [1823.0, 590.0], [1823.0, 640.0], [173.0, 640.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3. 员工级别培训（包括正式工、临时工、促销）由店长及主管培训负责。", "block_bbox": [174, 658, 1493, 708], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[174.0, 658.0], [1493.0, 658.0], [1493.0, 708.0], [174.0, 708.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "四、培训之路", "block_bbox": [101, 727, 361, 776], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[101.0, 727.0], [361.0, 727.0], [361.0, 776.0], [101.0, 776.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1. 胖东来为每个职位都设计了培训之路，一步一步的通过三个阶段来完成：认知阶段、掌握阶段和发展阶段。", "block_bbox": [172, 794, 2152, 845], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[172.0, 794.0], [2152.0, 794.0], [2152.0, 845.0], [172.0, 845.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2. 培训之路包括（但不限于）以下课程：", "block_bbox": [175, 862, 915, 912], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[175.0, 862.0], [915.0, 862.0], [915.0, 912.0], [175.0, 912.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "■ 胖东来理念培训\n■ 消防、交通、安全用电培训\n■ 营业部门员工基础培训\n■ 收银培训\n■ 保安培训\n■ 电脑技能培训\n■ 服务部门主管培训\n■ 课长培训\n■ 处长培训\n■ 店长培训", "block_bbox": [123, 938, 768, 1594], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[123.0, 938.0], [768.0, 938.0], [768.0, 1594.0], [123.0, 1594.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "五、培训记录", "block_bbox": [100, 1614, 364, 1662], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[100.0, 1614.0], [364.0, 1614.0], [364.0, 1662.0], [100.0, 1662.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "员工的培训记录由店跟踪负责。营业部门员工、收银员和保安部门员工均有相应的培训记录卡。店培训员在每次培训后作记录。", "block_bbox": [174, 1681, 2481, 1733], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[174.1990966796875, 1672.000732421875], [2480.19921875, 1681.000732421875], [2480.0, 1732.0], [174.0001220703125, 1723.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "25", "block_bbox": [2657, 1902, 2710, 1937], "block_id": 15, "block_order": null, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[2657.0, 1902.0], [2710.0, 1902.0], [2710.0, 1937.0], [2657.0, 1937.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.7810170650482178, "coordinate": [220, 113, 687, 162], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[220.0, 113.0], [687.0, 113.0], [687.0, 162.0], [220.0, 162.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8542921543121338, "coordinate": [174, 181, 873, 232], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[174.0, 181.0], [873.0, 181.0], [873.0, 232.0], [174.0, 232.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8671471476554871, "coordinate": [174, 250, 1408, 300], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[174.0, 250.0], [1408.0, 250.0], [1408.0, 300.0], [174.0, 300.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8560529351234436, "coordinate": [173, 317, 1491, 369], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[173.0, 317.0], [1491.0, 317.0], [1491.0, 369.0], [173.0, 369.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8639587163925171, "coordinate": [101, 385, 445, 435], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[101.0, 385.0], [445.0, 385.0], [445.0, 435.0], [101.0, 435.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8488319516181946, "coordinate": [178, 454, 500, 503], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[178.0, 454.0], [500.0, 454.0], [500.0, 503.0], [178.0, 503.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8587746620178223, "coordinate": [174, 522, 1698, 572], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[174.28955078125, 513.0017700195312], [1697.28955078125, 522.0017700195312], [1697.0, 571.0000610351562], [174.0, 562.0000610351562]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8707146048545837, "coordinate": [173, 590, 1823, 640], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[173.0, 590.0], [1823.0, 590.0], [1823.0, 640.0], [173.0, 640.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8550614714622498, "coordinate": [174, 658, 1493, 708], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[174.0, 658.0], [1493.0, 658.0], [1493.0, 708.0], [174.0, 708.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8806101679801941, "coordinate": [101, 727, 361, 776], "order": 10, "polygon_points": [[101.0, 727.0], [361.0, 727.0], [361.0, 776.0], [101.0, 776.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8786794543266296, "coordinate": [172, 794, 2152, 845], "order": 11, "polygon_points": [[172.0, 794.0], [2152.0, 794.0], [2152.0, 845.0], [172.0, 845.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8426046371459961, "coordinate": [175, 862, 915, 912], "order": 12, "polygon_points": [[175.0, 862.0], [915.0, 862.0], [915.0, 912.0], [175.0, 912.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.5524594187736511, "coordinate": [123, 938, 768, 1594], "order": 13, "polygon_points": [[123.0, 938.0], [768.0, 938.0], [768.0, 1594.0], [123.0, 1594.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8671033978462219, "coordinate": [100, 1614, 364, 1662], "order": 14, "polygon_points": [[100.0, 1614.0], [364.0, 1614.0], [364.0, 1662.0], [100.0, 1662.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8518216013908386, "coordinate": [174, 1681, 2481, 1733], "order": 15, "polygon_points": [[174.1990966796875, 1672.000732421875], [2480.19921875, 1681.000732421875], [2480.0, 1732.0], [174.0001220703125, 1723.0]]}, {"cls_id": 16, "label": "number", "score": 0.7073308825492859, "coordinate": [2657, 1902, 2710, 1937], "order": 16, "polygon_points": [[2657.0, 1902.0], [2710.0, 1902.0], [2710.0, 1937.0], [2657.0, 1937.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## 融入和丰富胖东来文化\n\n2. 在接受任何职位前，应先得到培训。\n\n3. 培训应当顺应顾客的期望，并有利于员工个人的发展和职位晋升。\n\n4. 管理层对培训的质量负责：他们参与培训并定期监督培训的实施情况。\n\n## 三、 培训组织结构\n\n胖东来培训机构：\n\n1. 处长以上级别的培训（包括店长、培训店长和处长），由上级主管部门进行培训。\n\n2. 课长级别培训（包括课长、培训课长、服务部门主管和助理）由各机构负责人负责培训。\n\n3. 员工级别培训（包括正式工、临时工、促销）由店长及主管培训负责。\n\n## 四、 培训之路\n\n1. 胖东来为每个职位都设计了培训之路，一步一步的通过三个阶段来完成：认知阶段、掌握阶段和发展阶段。\n\n2. 培训之路包括（但不限于）以下课程：\n\n■ 胖东来理念培训\n\n■ 消防、交通、安全用电培训\n\n■ 营业部门员工基础培训\n\n■ 收银培训\n\n■ 保安培训\n\n■ 电脑技能培训\n\n■ 服务部门主管培训\n\n■ 课长培训\n\n■ 处长培训\n\n■ 店长培训\n\n## 五、 培训记录\n\n员工的培训记录由店跟踪负责。营业部门员工、收银员和保安部门员工均有相应的培训记录卡。店培训员在每次培训后作记录。", "images": {}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//94f987ae-be27-43b4-952a-05f938e38530/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T09%3A41%3A33Z%2F-1%2F%2Fb8fba136b591a84446ffb06da5d3b92384c16bb35acc18754918cdf1723cd9c1"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//94f987ae-be27-43b4-952a-05f938e38530/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T09%3A41%3A33Z%2F-1%2F%2F7169b710a1bf143093e042b809558b5979eec5234ec9a0400bdf8f5cf182a7d3"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 2800, "height": 2000}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//94f987ae-be27-43b4-952a-05f938e38530/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T09%3A41%3A33Z%2F-1%2F%2Fc305db27378a0447ce74dbcc69af53574d3448fed5ef4e59ca69189051b05faf"]}, "errorCode": 0, "errorMsg": "Success"}
